       ORG 100

       Load  X     / load the 1st number (X) to be doubled
       Store Num   / use Num as a parameter to pass X to Twice
       JnS   Twice / store return address and jump to Twice
       Load  Res   / load the double of X returned by Twice
       Store X     / update X with its double
       Output      / show the new value of X

       Load  Y     / load the 2nd number (Y) to be doubled
       Store Num   / use Num as a parameter to pass Y to Twice
       JnS   Twice / store return address and jump to Twice
       Load  Res   / load the double of Y returned by Twice
       Store Y     / update Y with its double
       Output      / show the new value of Y

       Halt        / end program

Twice, Hex   0     / place to store return address
       Load  Num   / AC = Num
       Add   Num   / AC = AC + Num = Num + Num = 2 * Num
       Store Res   / Res = 2 * Num
       JumpI Twice / return to calling code

X,     Dec   20
Y,     Dec   48
Num,   Dec   0
Res,   Dec   0

